ntrols/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/30/WBB26_GREENBRIER_TIXONSALE_1920x1080.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/30/WBB26_GREENBRIER_TIXONSALE_1920x1080.jpg"><media:title>Greenbrier Tipoff Tickets on Sale</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/30/WBB26_GREENBRIER_TIXONSALE_1920x1080.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 11:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>9</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59457</s:story_id></item><item><title>Date for 2028 Tennessee Football Game Moved</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/30/date-for-2028-tennessee-football-game-moved</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/30/date-for-2028-tennessee-football-game-moved</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVU-TN-FB-Moved" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/30/239250a2-bc5c-11f1-b44f-0242ac120005.png" /><br /><br />The West Virginia University Department of Intercollegiate Athletics, the University of Tennessee Athletics Department and the Charlotte Sports Foundation have announced that the date for the Duke's Mayo Classic between WVU and Tennessee, originally scheduled for Sept. 2, 2028, in Bank of America Stadium in Charlotte, North Carolina, has been moved to Aug. 26, 2028.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/30/239250a2-bc5c-11f1-b44f-0242ac120005.png" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/30/239250a2-bc5c-11f1-b44f-0242ac120005.png"><media:title>WVU-TN-FB-Moved</media:title></media:content><enclosure u