sive Player of the Week</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/29/mens-soccer-redenfors-named-sun-belt-defensive-player-of-the-week</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/29/mens-soccer-redenfors-named-sun-belt-defensive-player-of-the-week</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Jacob Redenfors in action for WVU men's soccer against Marshall" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/29/GB701394.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – Junior Jacob Redenfors of the West Virginia University men's soccer team has been named the Sun Belt Defensive Player of the Week.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/29/GB701394.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/29/GB701394.jpg"><media:title>Jacob Redenfors in action for WVU men's soccer against Marshall</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/29/GB701394.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 12:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59455</s:story_id></item><item><title>Arizona Game to be Televised at Noon, ET on TNT/TruTV/HBO Max</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/28/football-arizona-game-to-be-televised-at-noon-et-on-tnt-trutv-hbo-max</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/28/football-arizona-game-to-be-televised-at-noon-et-on-tnt-trutv-hbo-max</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="CoalRushTime" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/28/WEBGameTimeAnnouncementCoalRush.JPG.jpeg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The Big 12 Conference has announced that WVU's Oct. 10 Big 12 Conference football home game against Arizona will be televised at noon, ET, on TNT and simulcast on TruTV and HBO Max.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/28/WEBGameTimeAnnouncementCoalRush.JPG.jpeg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/28/WEBGameTimeAnnouncementCoalRush.JPG.jpeg"><media:title>CoalRushTime</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/28/WEBGameTimeAnnouncementCoalRush.JPG.jpeg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:32:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59454</s:story_id></item><item><title>Muller Named Student-Athlete of the Week</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/28/rifle-muller-named-student-athlete-of-the-week</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/28/rifle-muller-named-student-athlete-of-the-week</guid><category>Rifle</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Oceanne Muller aims down range during a competition" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/28/DSC07793.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – Sophomore Oceanne Muller of the West Virginia University rifle team has been named the WVU Student-Athlete of the Week, presented by University Apartments.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/28/DSC07793.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/28/DSC07793.jpg"><media:title>Oceanne Muller aims down range during a competition</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/28/DSC07793.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:25:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>8</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59453</s:story_id></item><item><title>HARLEM GLOBETROTTERS: RIVALRY TOUR SET TO ARRIVE IN MORGANTOWN THIS SPRING A Whole New Game – A Whole New Group of Rivals! Coming to Hope Coliseum on March 27</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/28/general-harlem-globetrotters-rivalry-tour-set-to-arrive-in-morgantown-this-spring-a-whole-new-game-a-whole-new-group-of-rivals-coming-to-hope-coliseum-on-march-27</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/28/general-harlem-globetrotters-rivalry-tour-set-to-arrive-in-morgantown-this-spring-a-whole-new-game-a-whole-new-group-of-rivals-coming-to-hope-coliseum-on-march-27</guid><category>General</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Harlem Globetrotters are coming to Morgantown on March 27" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/28/BB26_GLOBETROTTERS_1920x1080.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. - Leaders in breaking barriers and making history, the world-famous Harlem Globetrotters™ today announced that Morgantown, West Virgina, will be a key stop on the Harlem Globetrotters: Rivalry Tour, set to play at Hope Coliseum on Saturday, March 27. This tour is unlike any other in 100 years, with a whole new game, a new lineup of rivals, and all-new challenges that raise the stakes at every stop. Fans won't just be watching, either - this season puts them in on the action, from the court to the jumbotron. It's basketball without limits - every possession turned into showtime - bringing the fun, the joy, and the history that only the Globetrotters can deliver. Tickets for Hope Coliseum will go on sale to the general public on Friday, October 2 at 10:00 AM local time.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/28/BB26_GLOBETROTTERS_1920x1080.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/28/BB26_GLOBETROTTERS_1920x1080.jpg"><media:title>Harlem Globetrotters are coming to Morgantown on March 27</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/28/BB26_GLOBETROTTERS_1920x1080.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 10:31:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>3</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59452</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Draw Marshall on the Road</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/27/mens-soccer-mountaineers-draw-marshall-on-the-road</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/27/mens-soccer-mountaineers-draw-marshall-on-the-road</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Jacob Redenfors in action against Marshall" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/29/GB701312.jpg" /><br /><br />HUNTINGTON, W.Va. – The 32nd edition of the Mountain State Derby between the No. 21 West Virginia University men's soccer team and Marshall ended in a 1-1 draw, Sunday night at Hoops Family Field. The Mountaineers go to 5-1-2 on the season and 1-0-1 in Sun Belt play while the Thundering Herd are now 4-1-3 and 1-0-1 as well in conference play.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/29/GB701312.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/29/GB701312.jpg"><media:title>Jacob Redenfors in action against Marshall</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/29/GB701312.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 21:55:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59450</s:story_id></item></channel></rss>